# local-codesystem-urn-collision root
library "Root".

// Two DISTINCT local libraries whose names slug to the SAME local codesystem
// URN (`urn:crl:codesystem:local-one-local`): "Local One" and "Local-One".
// Both use `code is`, so both synthesize that shared-URN local codesystem —
// their local codes would share a code domain and could collide. The
// cross-library preflight in imports/emit.ts must fail with
// `emit-local-codesystem-urn-collision`.

include "Local One".
include "Local-One".
